Package: ConverseR
Title: Next-Generation Context-Aware LLM Assistant and Sidebar for RStudio and Positron
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tyrone", "", , "tyrone@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A high-performance, fault-tolerant Large Language Model integration 
    for RStudio and Positron built on 'ellmer'. Overcomes the limitations of 
    first-generation inline assistants by providing a non-blocking background 
    Viewer Pane sidebar (via 'later' and 'httpuv' so your R console stays 100% 
    free while chatting), interactive OpenRouter model & privacy/ZDR/reasoning 
    configuration, a built-in SKILL.md and ZIP bundle loader, intelligent 
    windowed code context, AST-based and word-boundary environment inspection, 
    S3 class-aware summaries for statistical models and data frames, autonomous 
    tool-calling for live R session introspection, console-aware error fixes, 
    and throttled inline streaming.
